```

This contract makes use of PexObserve and Assert methods to visualize and validate the results obtained from the Remove method from an ArrayList. It also makes use of Debug.Assert to enforce additional constraints and verify the correctness of the code. 

You can add such contracts to validate the ArrayList behavior and debug its potential issues.--------------------